;Structures
: ''Structures can be directly targeted, but otherwise have the same (plus some additional) interactions. Some additional effects include {{ai|Stormbringer|Volibear}} and {{ai|Soaring Slam|Rammus}}.''

* Turret is one type of structure and has some effects that will trigger versus turrets but not other structures, such as {{ai|Explosive Charge|Tristana}}.
** {{cai|Shurima's Legacy|Azir|Sun Disc}}
* There are currently no examples of champion summoned inhibitors or other non-turret structures, but they are a distinct classification.

=== Targetable Traps ===
'''Traps''' are autonomous units that are triggered when valid targets come into their trigger range. In all existing cases, their damage is classified as [[ability damage]] and is credited to their champion.

These traps enter {{tip|stealth}} after a brief "arm time" and will be revealed by {{ii|Control Ward|Control Wards}}, {{tip|Sweeper Drone|Sweeper Drones}}, and {{iis|Umbral Glaive}} {{nie|Blackout}}.
* {{cai|Captive Audience|Jhin|Lotus Trap}}
* {{cai|Bushwhack|Nidalee}}
* {{cai|Jack in the Box|Shaco}}
* {{cai|Noxious Trap|Teemo}}

=== Miscellaneous / Wards ===
The following units have no known classification but can be safely tagged as allied/enemy "units", which makes them valid targets for {{ai|Safeguard|Lee Sin}} and {{si|Teleport}} but invalid targets for most other effects (i.e. things that affect minions, champions or any of the above categories). One possible classification for many of the following units is "Ward", since wards follow this behavior.

* {{cai|Powder Keg|Gangplank}}
* {{cai|Demacian Standard|Jarvan IV}} (untargetable)
* {{cai|Sentinel|Kalista}} (moves and grants sight only in front of it)
* {{cai|Tunnel|Rek'Sai}} (does not grant sight; targetable only by allies)
* {{cai|Dark Passage|Thresh|Soul Lantern}} (affects unit collision)
* {{tip|Control Ward}}
* {{tip|Farsight Ward}} (cannot be targeted by {{si|Teleport}})
* {{tip|Stealth Ward}} and {{tip|Totem Ward}}

